{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02634","headline":"游仙四首 三 · 王绩","name":"游仙四首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结衣寻野路，负杖入山门。\n道士言无宅，仙人更有村。\n斜溪横桂渚，小径入桃源。\n玉牀尘稍冷，金炉火尚温。\n心疑游北极，望似陟西崑。\n逆愁归旧里，萧条访子孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02634.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02634","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}